(4568608, 658773, 9763, '<td valign="top">I love the Salton Sea.  I made it to Mecca this weekend, but will be back at the sea before Summer.<br/> <br/>Great contrast, nice composition.  Great job!</td>', 'I love the Salton Sea.  I made it to Mecca this weekend, but will be back at the sea before Summer. Great contrast, nice composition.  Great job!', '2008-03-17 01:25:41.000000', NULL, 1),
