(4568612, 658198, 82985, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot--could go gray on that little bit of pinkish red in the background on the left  7</td>', 'I like this a lot--could go gray on that little bit of pinkish red in the background on the left  7', '2008-03-17 01:27:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4568616, 657745, 82985, '<td valign="top">this is so surreal, I can''t actually decide what to say: this is like Mythbusters--"I reject your reality and substitute my own."  7</td>', 'this is so surreal, I can''t actually decide what to say: this is like Mythbusters--"I reject your reality and substitute my own."  7', '2008-03-17 01:29:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4568619, 658198, 76676, '<td valign="top">I would like to see more of this scene. Nice shot, lighting is very nice!</td>', 'I would like to see more of this scene. Nice shot, lighting is very nice!', '2008-03-17 01:30:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4568623, 658084, 76676, '<td valign="top">Excellent!</td>', 'Excellent!', '2008-03-17 01:32:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4568624, 658564, 82985, '<td valign="top">looks more pleasant than harsh to me  (but it is cloudy, cold, and rainy in Seattle today, so I am definitely biased, suppose)  I like the tonality and luminosity very much.  A local burn on the left side to bring down that face of the building &amp; roof just a bit might work--the brightest element being on the extreme edge like that pulls the eye there a little too soon.</td>', 'looks more pleasant than harsh to me  (but it is cloudy, cold, and rainy in Seattle today, so I am definitely biased, suppose)  I like the tonality and luminosity very much.  A local burn on the left side to bring down that face of the building & roof just a bit might work--the brightest element being on the extreme edge like that pulls the eye there a little too soon.', '2008-03-17 01:32:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4568627, 658758, 82985, '<td valign="top">I like the composition here--the asymmetry creates the tension and the momentary mystery here.  Some might say it needs more saturation, but I will respectfully disagree if they do--the subtle tonalities here are wonderful.  A small lift in the white level (very small, mind you) might be nice to try, but might ruin it, too.  NICE.  8</td>', 'I like the composition here--the asymmetry creates the tension and the momentary mystery here.  Some might say it needs more saturation, but I will respectfully disagree if they do--the subtle tonalities here are wonderful.  A small lift in the white level (very small, mind you) might be nice to try, but might ruin it, too.  NICE.  8', '2008-03-17 01:35:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4568628, 658803, 52449, '<td valign="top">I kinda like this abstract composition. However, it looks like a large aperture was used since the writing on the cup (or bowl) at the bottem right of the image does not appear to be within the depth-of-field.</td>', 'I kinda like this abstract composition. However, it looks like a large aperture was used since the writing on the cup (or bowl) at the bottem right of the image does not appear to be within the depth-of-field.', '2008-03-17 01:36:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4568630, 658480, 82985, '<td valign="top">I love images like this with lots of textures and layers and "sub-images"  This is, no doubt, best seen Large with lots of time to explore the image.  Pity about the size limit here, eh? 9</td>', 'I love images like this with lots of textures and layers and "sub-images"  This is, no doubt, best seen Large with lots of time to explore the image.  Pity about the size limit here, eh? 9', '2008-03-17 01:37:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4568631, 658730, 82985, '<td valign="top">I love the composition and forms here--the color cast is not doing it for me though, not sure why.  7</td>', 'I love the composition and forms here--the color cast is not doing it for me though, not sure why.  7', '2008-03-17 01:38:53.000000', NULL, 1),
