(4570620, 657240, 19572, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors in the sky, this is great.</td>', 'Beautiful colors in the sky, this is great.', '2008-03-18 02:16:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4570621, 658622, 19572, '<td valign="top">I''m not entirely sure what i''m looking at, but i like it.</td>', 'I''m not entirely sure what i''m looking at, but i like it.', '2008-03-18 02:16:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4570634, 658553, 68035, '<td valign="top">Really like the minimalism on this shot together with the dof you have used.  Nice application of rule of thirds as well.<br/> <br/>I am not sure that this picture is what it first may appear to be (when I opened it I thought parched earth, but the more I look at it the more it seems to be almost like skinned plaster which has begun to peel).  Regardless of what it is physically of one thing I am sure, its a very good image</td>', 'Really like the minimalism on this shot together with the dof you have used.  Nice application of rule of thirds as well. I am not sure that this picture is what it first may appear to be (when I opened it I thought parched earth, but the more I look at it the more it seems to be almost like skinned plaster which has begun to peel).  Regardless of what it is physically of one thing I am sure, its a very good image', '2008-03-18 02:58:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4570638, 657745, 63812, '<td valign="top">very nice</td>', 'very nice', '2008-03-18 03:12:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4570687, 658802, 68035, '<td valign="top">Supern shot of hectares of desolations which is wonderfully set off by the bush in the foreground.  Great clarity and colours</td>', 'Supern shot of hectares of desolations which is wonderfully set off by the bush in the foreground.  Great clarity and colours', '2008-03-18 04:50:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4570689, 658730, 68035, '<td valign="top">Really outstanding example of an urban nightmare.  This picture is made by the incredible composition that you applied.  String stark leading lines and a real sense of being overpowered by concrete.  Vert impressive the way you have kept the colours bright yet still made them feel oppressive.  One of my favourites in the challenge - 9</td>', 'Really outstanding example of an urban nightmare.  This picture is made by the incredible composition that you applied.  String stark leading lines and a real sense of being overpowered by concrete.  Vert impressive the way you have kept the colours bright yet still made them feel oppressive.  One of my favourites in the challenge - 9', '2008-03-18 04:54:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4570690, 658561, 68035, '<td valign="top">I know that titles should not really count for anything but I do have to say that yours made me laugh out loud.<br/> <br/>Incredible landscape.  This almost suffers in terms of the challenge in that you have created an image of such overwhelming beauty that it takes away from what is indeed a harsh environment<br/> <br/>The type of shot that leaves me both awestruck and envious<br/> <br/>Brilliant</td>', 'I know that titles should not really count for anything but I do have to say that yours made me laugh out loud. Incredible landscape.  This almost suffers in terms of the challenge in that you have created an image of such overwhelming beauty that it takes away from what is indeed a harsh environment The type of shot that leaves me both awestruck and envious Brilliant', '2008-03-18 04:57:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4570692, 657713, 68035, '<td valign="top">Oh my goodness, this is an outrageously good image for the challenge.  Fantastic composition and great clarity given the weather conditions.  This is an image that you dont just look at...you feel!<br/> <br/>I love the B&amp;W conversion<br/> <br/>Its a ten from me and adding to favourites.  <br/> <br/>Simply perfect.  Thank you</td>', 'Oh my goodness, this is an outrageously good image for the challenge.  Fantastic composition and great clarity given the weather conditions.  This is an image that you dont just look at...you feel! I love the B&W conversion Its a ten from me and adding to favourites.   Simply perfect.  Thank you', '2008-03-18 04:59:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4570694, 657176, 68035, '<td valign="top">What a stunning landscape that blends incredible beauty and utter bleakness seamlessly.  Incredible dof and sharpness and wonderful colours.  The sun/shadow play really make this shot in terms of the challenge. 10 from me</td>', 'What a stunning landscape that blends incredible beauty and utter bleakness seamlessly.  Incredible dof and sharpness and wonderful colours.  The sun/shadow play really make this shot in terms of the challenge. 10 from me', '2008-03-18 05:04:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4570695, 658198, 68035, '<td valign="top">Wow, what a stunning photograph that wonderfully epitomises the challenge.  Love the sense of aged dereliction in terms of the hull of the ship and the feeling of entrapment by the ice (which looks incredibly powerful).  perhaps just a fraction overdone on the red hue and sat (and then it is only the leading buoy that looks a bit odd as it works well on the red paintwork elsewhere) but still a wonderful 9.<br/> <br/>Great image</td>', 'Wow, what a stunning photograph that wonderfully epitomises the challenge.  Love the sense of aged dereliction in terms of the hull of the ship and the feeling of entrapment by the ice (which looks incredibly powerful).  perhaps just a fraction overdone on the red hue and sat (and then it is only the leading buoy that looks a bit odd as it works well on the red paintwork elsewhere) but still a wonderful 9. Great image', '2008-03-18 05:07:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4570773, 658315, 674, '<td valign="top">looks too pretty for a harsh environment</td>', 'looks too pretty for a harsh environment', '2008-03-18 07:26:32.000000', NULL, 1),
