(4572458, 657714, 6179, '<td valign="top">Ok, you are going to really get slammed on this one. Hope you are going for a brown ribbon on this because I feel that this may come in last place. Sorry. Very creative though</td>', 'Ok, you are going to really get slammed on this one. Hope you are going for a brown ribbon on this because I feel that this may come in last place. Sorry. Very creative though', '2008-03-18 23:30:37.000000', NULL, 1),
