(4573538, 658559, 36494, '<td valign="top">love this image for this challenge</td>', 'love this image for this challenge', '2008-03-19 10:17:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4573541, 658337, 36494, '<td valign="top">This is a great action shot and I get the harsh enviornment part</td>', 'This is a great action shot and I get the harsh enviornment part', '2008-03-19 10:18:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4573542, 658094, 36494, '<td valign="top">love the water image 7</td>', 'love the water image 7', '2008-03-19 10:18:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4573547, 657343, 36494, '<td valign="top">powerful image ...nice</td>', 'powerful image ...nice', '2008-03-19 10:20:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4573549, 657474, 36494, '<td valign="top">great job</td>', 'great job', '2008-03-19 10:21:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4573553, 658784, 91498, '<td valign="top">I love this picture.<br/>The concept and the way it came out is absolutely stunning and beautiful. =)</td>', 'I love this picture.The concept and the way it came out is absolutely stunning and beautiful. =)', '2008-03-19 10:22:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4573569, 658617, 45790, '<td valign="top">I like the silhouette against the sky. I do wonder about the foliage at the bottom -- it looks like low lying weeds which would place the climber only a few feet off the ground. It would be more "harsh" if he appeared as though he were higher up.</td>', 'I like the silhouette against the sky. I do wonder about the foliage at the bottom -- it looks like low lying weeds which would place the climber only a few feet off the ground. It would be more "harsh" if he appeared as though he were higher up.', '2008-03-19 10:33:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4573572, 658804, 45790, '<td valign="top">Nice and sharp!</td>', 'Nice and sharp!', '2008-03-19 10:34:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4573576, 658712, 45790, '<td valign="top">So close I can''t tell what I''m looking at. If it is a flame, what is the grid pattern particularly in the orange area?<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-03-26 10:27:40.</i></td>', 'So close I can''t tell what I''m looking at. If it is a flame, what is the grid pattern particularly in the orange area?', '2008-03-19 10:37:44.000000', '2008-03-26 10:27:40.000000', 1),
(4573582, 658604, 45790, '<td valign="top">Very intriguing! I like the back lighting but don''t like the black splotches at the top toward the left. Also the blue, dark image seems cold rather than 42 degrees.</td>', 'Very intriguing! I like the back lighting but don''t like the black splotches at the top toward the left. Also the blue, dark image seems cold rather than 42 degrees.', '2008-03-19 10:40:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4573585, 658322, 45790, '<td valign="top">What would really be funny is if this really were shot in Iceland! Global warming? So much detail it begs to be enlarged -- I''m sure the resolution limits here don''t do it justice.</td>', 'What would really be funny is if this really were shot in Iceland! Global warming? So much detail it begs to be enlarged -- I''m sure the resolution limits here don''t do it justice.', '2008-03-19 10:42:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4573590, 657235, 45790, '<td valign="top">Fantastic. B&amp;W conversion worked well with high contrast result.</td>', 'Fantastic. B&W conversion worked well with high contrast result.', '2008-03-19 10:44:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4573603, 658049, 45790, '<td valign="top">The tilt of the image and that of the telephone poles seem to create an optical illusion that sometimes the steps seem to be going up rather than down.</td>', 'The tilt of the image and that of the telephone poles seem to create an optical illusion that sometimes the steps seem to be going up rather than down.', '2008-03-19 10:49:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4573610, 658307, 45790, '<td valign="top">I like all the grain. Certainly indicates harshness, but tends to be avoided at DPC.</td>', 'I like all the grain. Certainly indicates harshness, but tends to be avoided at DPC.', '2008-03-19 10:51:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4573614, 658069, 45790, '<td valign="top">Tree makes tone mapping too obvious.</td>', 'Tree makes tone mapping too obvious.', '2008-03-19 10:53:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4573685, 657697, 85886, '<td valign="top">For me this isn''t a particularly harsh environment, but as a photograph I love it.  What I really like about it is the strong black and white conversion with strong contrast, the teeny weeny bit of movement in her leg and hair, and above all the lighting and tonal range.  I like the fact that you don''t see her face because it would only detract from the scene.  Probably a bit too subtle for the typical DPC vote but a very strong image nevertheless.</td>', 'For me this isn''t a particularly harsh environment, but as a photograph I love it.  What I really like about it is the strong black and white conversion with strong contrast, the teeny weeny bit of movement in her leg and hair, and above all the lighting and tonal range.  I like the fact that you don''t see her face because it would only detract from the scene.  Probably a bit too subtle for the typical DPC vote but a very strong image nevertheless.', '2008-03-19 11:13:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4573699, 658711, 85886, '<td valign="top">Very clever - love the idea and execution.  Great lines and wonderful textures from the surface stuff.  Only real issue is that grey part of the sky where it was blown out....not sure that maybe cloning it out might have been a better idea.</td>', 'Very clever - love the idea and execution.  Great lines and wonderful textures from the surface stuff.  Only real issue is that grey part of the sky where it was blown out....not sure that maybe cloning it out might have been a better idea.', '2008-03-19 11:16:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4573718, 657714, 85886, '<td valign="top">Gee, what a genius you are.  Next time you choose to exercise your brilliant mind at least submit in 640px.</td>', 'Gee, what a genius you are.  Next time you choose to exercise your brilliant mind at least submit in 640px.', '2008-03-19 11:19:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4573725, 657213, 85886, '<td valign="top">Fantastic picture but the environment doesn''t imply any harshness to me.</td>', 'Fantastic picture but the environment doesn''t imply any harshness to me.', '2008-03-19 11:20:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4573743, 658602, 85886, '<td valign="top">I can''t explain it but this really appeals.  I think it has to be the muted lighting and colour.  I love the retention of detail in the buildings so that they''re not silhouetted entirely and the blueish tones against the browns in the sky.  Very cool stuff.</td>', 'I can''t explain it but this really appeals.  I think it has to be the muted lighting and colour.  I love the retention of detail in the buildings so that they''re not silhouetted entirely and the blueish tones against the browns in the sky.  Very cool stuff.', '2008-03-19 11:25:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4573747, 658087, 85886, '<td valign="top">Awww...you lay off that rhubarb.  Wait..I hate rhubarb...especially with custard.  Step on :)  Love the selective desat and the PoV.  Prolly a bit too quirky for this lot but a really original shot and well executed.</td>', 'Awww...you lay off that rhubarb.  Wait..I hate rhubarb...especially with custard.  Step on :)  Love the selective desat and the PoV.  Prolly a bit too quirky for this lot but a really original shot and well executed.', '2008-03-19 11:27:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4573755, 658702, 85886, '<td valign="top">Well if you didn''t shoot grainy undersized images with better control of your white levels maybe it wouldn''t be quite so harsh.</td>', 'Well if you didn''t shoot grainy undersized images with better control of your white levels maybe it wouldn''t be quite so harsh.', '2008-03-19 11:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4573761, 657728, 85886, '<td valign="top">Absolutely brilliant.  This is my favourite so far by a long long way.  It''s original, the composition is great with the leading lines from feet and bulbs, and the tonal contrast from the b&amp;w conversion.  Anyone that comments about it being off centre is talking hot air imho :)  Well done - giving this a 10.</td>', 'Absolutely brilliant.  This is my favourite so far by a long long way.  It''s original, the composition is great with the leading lines from feet and bulbs, and the tonal contrast from the b&w conversion.  Anyone that comments about it being off centre is talking hot air imho :)  Well done - giving this a 10.', '2008-03-19 11:32:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4573763, 657713, 85886, '<td valign="top">Very nice - I just wish it had just a touch more contrast, or heavier blacks.  You''ve really captured the torrential rain and that poor woman caught in it without a brolly....definitely a harsh environment with nice composition, but just let down but the tonal contrast I think.</td>', 'Very nice - I just wish it had just a touch more contrast, or heavier blacks.  You''ve really captured the torrential rain and that poor woman caught in it without a brolly....definitely a harsh environment with nice composition, but just let down but the tonal contrast I think.', '2008-03-19 11:33:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4573770, 658548, 85886, '<td valign="top">Fan-flipping-tastic.  Nailed it.  Insta-ribbon :)</td>', 'Fan-flipping-tastic.  Nailed it.  Insta-ribbon :)', '2008-03-19 11:36:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4573801, 658556, 44877, '<td valign="top">Wow - this is amazing.</td>', 'Wow - this is amazing.', '2008-03-19 11:45:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4574290, 657714, 89341, '<td valign="top">I''m not even going to dignify this with a one, total waste of my time :o(</td>', 'I''m not even going to dignify this with a one, total waste of my time :o(', '2008-03-19 13:53:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4574296, 658723, 89341, '<td valign="top">Great capture</td>', 'Great capture', '2008-03-19 13:55:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4574301, 657745, 89341, '<td valign="top">Fantastic colours and great depth to the photo</td>', 'Fantastic colours and great depth to the photo', '2008-03-19 13:55:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4574496, 657213, 24454, '<td valign="top">I love photos that have this "look".   There''s something about the finishing that looks so rich and amazing.   And I love the gritty feel.   Good luck!   9</td>', 'I love photos that have this "look".   There''s something about the finishing that looks so rich and amazing.   And I love the gritty feel.   Good luck!   9', '2008-03-19 15:10:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4574498, 658735, 24454, '<td valign="top">How beautiful!   Looks like a National Geographic photo!</td>', 'How beautiful!   Looks like a National Geographic photo!', '2008-03-19 15:11:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4574526, 657713, 29156, '<td valign="top">beautiful b&amp;w tones</td>', 'beautiful b&w tones', '2008-03-19 15:25:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4574594, 658651, 68947, '<td valign="top">Awwww.......so cute!</td>', 'Awwww.......so cute!', '2008-03-19 15:56:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4574599, 657714, 68947, '<td valign="top">LOL!!!  Heading for the "Brown" are we? *grin*  This one made me really chuckle!  Sorry, but you get a decent mark for making me laugh!</td>', 'LOL!!!  Heading for the "Brown" are we? *grin*  This one made me really chuckle!  Sorry, but you get a decent mark for making me laugh!', '2008-03-19 15:57:54.000000', NULL, 1),
