(4574612, 658603, 68947, '<td valign="top">Really great interpretation of this!  I think that I''d like to have seen something "in" the doorway there to sort of give the composition a bit more "oomphhhh" so to speak.  Love the outside the box thinking!</td>', 'Really great interpretation of this!  I think that I''d like to have seen something "in" the doorway there to sort of give the composition a bit more "oomphhhh" so to speak.  Love the outside the box thinking!', '2008-03-19 16:01:08.000000', NULL, 1),
