(4574617, 658647, 68947, '<td valign="top">Ok, this one made me laugh!  Have to give you a good score just because it made me laugh!  You''re a "nut"! *grin*</td>', 'Ok, this one made me laugh!  Have to give you a good score just because it made me laugh!  You''re a "nut"! *grin*', '2008-03-19 16:02:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4574619, 658556, 68947, '<td valign="top">Ok, that is "harsh" and it was a great capture!</td>', 'Ok, that is "harsh" and it was a great capture!', '2008-03-19 16:03:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4574627, 658199, 68947, '<td valign="top">Lovely editing!  Very nicely done!  It does show "harshness" and it is a wonderfully skilled editing piece but, somehow, it kind of lacks something that I can''t quite put my finger on.  It''s likely just my personal tastes.  Doesn''t make me right.  Just my personal opinion only.</td>', 'Lovely editing!  Very nicely done!  It does show "harshness" and it is a wonderfully skilled editing piece but, somehow, it kind of lacks something that I can''t quite put my finger on.  It''s likely just my personal tastes.  Doesn''t make me right.  Just my personal opinion only.', '2008-03-19 16:05:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4574628, 658420, 68947, '<td valign="top">Love the dog in the doorway there!  Brilliant color contrast!</td>', 'Love the dog in the doorway there!  Brilliant color contrast!', '2008-03-19 16:05:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4574632, 658243, 68947, '<td valign="top">Love the shot.  It certainly hits the "harsh".  Somehow the green river just doesn''t sit well.  Not sure why.  Might be just my personal taste, but lovely shot!</td>', 'Love the shot.  It certainly hits the "harsh".  Somehow the green river just doesn''t sit well.  Not sure why.  Might be just my personal taste, but lovely shot!', '2008-03-19 16:06:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4574635, 658074, 68947, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot!  But, feels a bit "shoehorned" for this challenge.</td>', 'Lovely shot!  But, feels a bit "shoehorned" for this challenge.', '2008-03-19 16:07:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4574639, 658548, 68947, '<td valign="top">Wow, a lovely shot....colors are really vibrant!</td>', 'Wow, a lovely shot....colors are really vibrant!', '2008-03-19 16:08:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4574641, 658611, 68947, '<td valign="top">Uh, yeah, that does show "harshness" very well!</td>', 'Uh, yeah, that does show "harshness" very well!', '2008-03-19 16:09:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4574648, 658806, 68947, '<td valign="top">wonderful shot!  Very lovely colors and composition!  Even though I know the harshness of erosion, it still looks very "serene"! *smile*</td>', 'wonderful shot!  Very lovely colors and composition!  Even though I know the harshness of erosion, it still looks very "serene"! *smile*', '2008-03-19 16:12:22.000000', NULL, 1),
