(4574651, 658792, 68947, '<td valign="top">Does look "harsh"!  The editing on this really makes this shot.</td>', 'Does look "harsh"!  The editing on this really makes this shot.', '2008-03-19 16:13:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4574663, 658631, 68947, '<td valign="top">Ok, with all of the "harsh" scenery shots in this challenge, all of the birds eating insects/wildlife.....THIS shot really stands right out!  LOVE IT!!!  I''m not a traditional voter in the sense that I go for the "highly manipulated" scenery shots so, this one really hit me well!  I think we need more photos like this in DPC and hopefully, voters will eventually see the "value" in shots like this one.  <br/> <br/>Not sure how you''re doing score wise.  My bet is that your score is kind of suffering somewhat due to it not being a traditionally "loved" shot here, but to me, it''s brilliant!  Nicely done! 9</td>', 'Ok, with all of the "harsh" scenery shots in this challenge, all of the birds eating insects/wildlife.....THIS shot really stands right out!  LOVE IT!!!  I''m not a traditional voter in the sense that I go for the "highly manipulated" scenery shots so, this one really hit me well!  I think we need more photos like this in DPC and hopefully, voters will eventually see the "value" in shots like this one.   Not sure how you''re doing score wise.  My bet is that your score is kind of suffering somewhat due to it not being a traditionally "loved" shot here, but to me, it''s brilliant!  Nicely done! 9', '2008-03-19 16:16:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4574670, 657728, 68947, '<td valign="top">Wow, now that proves that you''re one obsessed photographer! LOL  Camera in a tanning bed! *grin*</td>', 'Wow, now that proves that you''re one obsessed photographer! LOL  Camera in a tanning bed! *grin*', '2008-03-19 16:18:20.000000', NULL, 1),
