(4575496, 658420, 72318, '<td valign="top">urm - yeah - vikings had corugated iron and concrete... of course! Bit to tight of a crop considering the second part of your title - i see little if any ofthis land you speak of. Basically i think you were trying to hard with the title and it lost any significance. Nice colours and detail in the shot, but uninspired composition imo...</td>', 'urm - yeah - vikings had corugated iron and concrete... of course! Bit to tight of a crop considering the second part of your title - i see little if any ofthis land you speak of. Basically i think you were trying to hard with the title and it lost any significance. Nice colours and detail in the shot, but uninspired composition imo...', '2008-03-19 21:47:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4575499, 657714, 72318, '<td valign="top">They have lights in a coal mine... so i say you are a liar and didnt actually take this in a coal mine and are misleading us with the title! ;-P  good luck, i''m not sure this is something DPC voters like... but it made me smile in recognition of the thought behind it at least :)</td>', 'They have lights in a coal mine... so i say you are a liar and didnt actually take this in a coal mine and are misleading us with the title! ;-P  good luck, i''m not sure this is something DPC voters like... but it made me smile in recognition of the thought behind it at least :)', '2008-03-19 21:50:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4575503, 657029, 72318, '<td valign="top">Nice shot compositionally, conceptually and tonally but looses any impact with the loss of detail it seems to suffer from :''( Eyes are the key in this kind of shot as they tell the sadness, without them glaring back at you clear as day the shot suffers...</td>', 'Nice shot compositionally, conceptually and tonally but looses any impact with the loss of detail it seems to suffer from :''( Eyes are the key in this kind of shot as they tell the sadness, without them glaring back at you clear as day the shot suffers...', '2008-03-19 21:53:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4575562, 658074, 72318, '<td valign="top">love the connection with the bride in this shot through the eye contact and pose. Conceptually it speaks more of incongruity than harsh environments tho... although you are still in the bounds of my benefit of the doubt as i can see it. (put it this way - i doubt you set this shot up exclusively for the challenge ;P)</td>', 'love the connection with the bride in this shot through the eye contact and pose. Conceptually it speaks more of incongruity than harsh environments tho... although you are still in the bounds of my benefit of the doubt as i can see it. (put it this way - i doubt you set this shot up exclusively for the challenge ;P)', '2008-03-19 22:22:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4575563, 658750, 72318, '<td valign="top">as does this shot - nice touch with his hands :)  Approaches the subject at a mental rather than physical level which is a rarety in this challenge... nicely done!</td>', 'as does this shot - nice touch with his hands :)  Approaches the subject at a mental rather than physical level which is a rarety in this challenge... nicely done!', '2008-03-19 22:23:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4575564, 658521, 72318, '<td valign="top">excellent execution, but it seems a tenuous link to a "Harsh" environment... i think it might be because the shot looks so nice that it looses any sense of harshness, i just see beauty... and the current state of affairs (ie puddle) is a fairly normal environment for a leaf, not a harsh one... still scores well in my book as it is probably (criteria aside) my fav shot in this challenge...</td>', 'excellent execution, but it seems a tenuous link to a "Harsh" environment... i think it might be because the shot looks so nice that it looses any sense of harshness, i just see beauty... and the current state of affairs (ie puddle) is a fairly normal environment for a leaf, not a harsh one... still scores well in my book as it is probably (criteria aside) my fav shot in this challenge...', '2008-03-19 22:23:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4575613, 657235, 72670, '<td valign="top">Spectacular! Blue for sure!</td>', 'Spectacular! Blue for sure!', '2008-03-19 22:47:10.000000', NULL, 1),
