(4575670, 657213, 72670, '<td valign="top">I really like this "grunge" effect in this shot. I just don''t like the pose for this challenge. If maybe she was a little greased up and portrayed as living in or working in a tough environment. i think that would make the shot for me.</td>', 'I really like this "grunge" effect in this shot. I just don''t like the pose for this challenge. If maybe she was a little greased up and portrayed as living in or working in a tough environment. i think that would make the shot for me.', '2008-03-19 23:11:28.000000', NULL, 1),
