(4576257, 658307, 36981, '<td valign="top">This is only my second image I''m voting on, but I already know it will be one of my favorites in this challenge.  I love the starkness, the crop &amp; composition, the inclusion of the person in that exact spot, the grain, everything.  It''s wonderful.</td>', 'This is only my second image I''m voting on, but I already know it will be one of my favorites in this challenge.  I love the starkness, the crop & composition, the inclusion of the person in that exact spot, the grain, everything.  It''s wonderful.', '2008-03-20 08:45:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4576330, 657029, 58457, '<td valign="top">Well now, that is just sad!</td>', 'Well now, that is just sad!', '2008-03-20 09:22:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4576337, 658084, 58457, '<td valign="top">brrr!  This is a pretty intense shot!  I''m wondering where it is and how you got there!</td>', 'brrr!  This is a pretty intense shot!  I''m wondering where it is and how you got there!', '2008-03-20 09:24:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4576344, 658602, 58457, '<td valign="top">I get that you were trying to create a mood here, but for me, its just <i>too </i>dark.  I can''t make enough out. Maybe a few minutes earlier or later if the shot was taken near dusk or dawn could''ve given the shot more depth.</td>', 'I get that you were trying to create a mood here, but for me, its just too dark.  I can''t make enough out. Maybe a few minutes earlier or later if the shot was taken near dusk or dawn could''ve given the shot more depth.', '2008-03-20 09:29:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4576369, 657745, 70875, '<td valign="top">Fabulous :)</td>', 'Fabulous :)', '2008-03-20 09:39:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4576379, 658485, 70875, '<td valign="top">I find this very intriguing. Chaotic but balanced in some way... i just like it.</td>', 'I find this very intriguing. Chaotic but balanced in some way... i just like it.', '2008-03-20 09:43:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4576384, 658307, 70875, '<td valign="top">Nordic winter? I like the minimalistic look.</td>', 'Nordic winter? I like the minimalistic look.', '2008-03-20 09:47:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4576401, 658711, 79816, '<td valign="top">I think this would be stronger without the flower. It distracts me from what is a powerful looking scene.</td>', 'I think this would be stronger without the flower. It distracts me from what is a powerful looking scene.', '2008-03-20 10:00:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4576441, 657728, 68514, '<td valign="top">Ah ah ah...great shot, funny and original :) 9</td>', 'Ah ah ah...great shot, funny and original :) 9', '2008-03-20 10:23:28.000000', NULL, 1),
