(4576522, 657714, 45790, '<td valign="top">A look at the lowest scoring photos on this site shows many images like yours, so are you going for the "brown ribbon"? A coal mine is certainly a harsh environment, but I''d use a flash.</td>', 'A look at the lowest scoring photos on this site shows many images like yours, so are you going for the "brown ribbon"? A coal mine is certainly a harsh environment, but I''d use a flash.', '2008-03-20 11:02:24.000000', NULL, 1),
