(4577258, 658736, 67258, '<td valign="top">Nick?  Interesting processing - the composition is superb, especially with the pedestrian walking into the framein front of the bus (was that one of our group?).  Have you tried a perspective corection?  The trouble with that, I guess, is that you would probably lose the pedestrian and the front/rear of the bus, which are currently strong compositional elements.  Overall, I like this, and it certainly fits well with my memory of the scene,</td>', 'Nick?  Interesting processing - the composition is superb, especially with the pedestrian walking into the framein front of the bus (was that one of our group?).  Have you tried a perspective corection?  The trouble with that, I guess, is that you would probably lose the pedestrian and the front/rear of the bus, which are currently strong compositional elements.  Overall, I like this, and it certainly fits well with my memory of the scene,', '2008-03-20 15:36:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4577261, 658514, 39349, '<td valign="top">This is a VERY nice shot the tones from green to blue / purple and orange are just awesome. I don''t really think that this meets the challenge of "Harsh Environments" but hey, it''s a nice shot.</td>', 'This is a VERY nice shot the tones from green to blue / purple and orange are just awesome. I don''t really think that this meets the challenge of "Harsh Environments" but hey, it''s a nice shot.', '2008-03-20 15:37:37.000000', NULL, 1),
