(4579117, 657713, 90387, '<td valign="top">Great shot, and one of my top three for the challenge.  Was the foggy effect at the bottom caused by the rain, or processing?  Either way, great job.</td>', 'Great shot, and one of my top three for the challenge.  Was the foggy effect at the bottom caused by the rain, or processing?  Either way, great job.', '2008-03-21 18:13:11.000000', NULL, 1),
