(4579180, 658209, 90387, '<td valign="top">I''m not normally a fan of square crops, for whatever reason, but I Think it really works here.  One of my top choices for the challenge.  good luck with it!</td>', 'I''m not normally a fan of square crops, for whatever reason, but I Think it really works here.  One of my top choices for the challenge.  good luck with it!', '2008-03-21 18:57:08.000000', NULL, 1),
