(4579857, 657714, 54645, '<td valign="top">Perfect tone, low noise in the image available. Nothing distracting in the composition. Seriously though, I love the implication, and the title takes me straight to a very dark place. Some may c 10</td>', 'Perfect tone, low noise in the image available. Nothing distracting in the composition. Seriously though, I love the implication, and the title takes me straight to a very dark place. Some may c 10', '2008-03-22 09:48:45.000000', NULL, 1),
