(4579873, 658711, 54645, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but the transplanted flower just does not look real. It''s not integrated into the photo, or should I say digital art, well enough to pull it off. I really like the tones though. One last suggestion, clone out the piece of blue sky.</td>', 'Good idea, but the transplanted flower just does not look real. It''s not integrated into the photo, or should I say digital art, well enough to pull it off. I really like the tones though. One last suggestion, clone out the piece of blue sky.', '2008-03-22 09:57:56.000000', NULL, 1),
