(4579876, 658485, 54645, '<td valign="top">Not many voters will know that the Land of Oz is a harsh place, so I presume you read a number of the books. The image is very good and I love the bottom half. I love to see the top of the tree in the composistion. 9</td>', 'Not many voters will know that the Land of Oz is a harsh place, so I presume you read a number of the books. The image is very good and I love the bottom half. I love to see the top of the tree in the composistion. 9', '2008-03-22 10:02:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4579911, 658739, 88923, '<td valign="top">A beautiful photo with the frog''s eye nicely in focus. 9</td>', 'A beautiful photo with the frog''s eye nicely in focus. 9', '2008-03-22 10:32:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4579916, 657713, 88923, '<td valign="top">I love the feel of this, the strength of the rain, the strength of the woman, the hazy atmosphere, the composition.</td>', 'I love the feel of this, the strength of the rain, the strength of the woman, the hazy atmosphere, the composition.', '2008-03-22 10:34:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4579980, 657745, 88923, '<td valign="top">Wow, the approaching storm really speaks out with the colours.  One of my favorites.</td>', 'Wow, the approaching storm really speaks out with the colours.  One of my favorites.', '2008-03-22 11:16:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4579981, 658521, 88923, '<td valign="top">Love the water drop and the rich tones.</td>', 'Love the water drop and the rich tones.', '2008-03-22 11:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4579982, 656974, 88923, '<td valign="top">I love the sun on this, the warm combination of colours, and the composition.  Nicely done.</td>', 'I love the sun on this, the warm combination of colours, and the composition.  Nicely done.', '2008-03-22 11:17:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4579983, 658315, 88923, '<td valign="top">The blended colours, and misty fog give this photo a nice impression.</td>', 'The blended colours, and misty fog give this photo a nice impression.', '2008-03-22 11:17:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4579986, 658763, 88923, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  And the photo goes on forever (well to the horizon).  In my opinion this should ribbon.</td>', 'Beautiful.  And the photo goes on forever (well to the horizon).  In my opinion this should ribbon.', '2008-03-22 11:17:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4579987, 658711, 88923, '<td valign="top">Beautiful concept!  The beauty and colour of the flower makes it stand out amidst a harsh environment.</td>', 'Beautiful concept!  The beauty and colour of the flower makes it stand out amidst a harsh environment.', '2008-03-22 11:17:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4579994, 658799, 88923, '<td valign="top">I love that cactus....  We never seem to be in CA when the cactus'' are blooming.  It''s a nice expression of beauty amongst the harshest environments.</td>', 'I love that cactus....  We never seem to be in CA when the cactus'' are blooming.  It''s a nice expression of beauty amongst the harshest environments.', '2008-03-22 11:19:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4579995, 658178, 88923, '<td valign="top">Impressive photo.  I love the soft creaminess of the shore here with the blend of rocky outposts.</td>', 'Impressive photo.  I love the soft creaminess of the shore here with the blend of rocky outposts.', '2008-03-22 11:20:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4579997, 658604, 88923, '<td valign="top">I love the rings here, the white sun ring, then the aqua ring then the outer blue, then the dark corners melding with the trees and foreground.   Impressive photo. 9</td>', 'I love the rings here, the white sun ring, then the aqua ring then the outer blue, then the dark corners melding with the trees and foreground.   Impressive photo. 9', '2008-03-22 11:22:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4579999, 658145, 88923, '<td valign="top">Ah, this is impressive, the creamy, salty rocks really create an impression.</td>', 'Ah, this is impressive, the creamy, salty rocks really create an impression.', '2008-03-22 11:23:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580006, 658728, 88923, '<td valign="top">Impressive photo.  I love the angle that this photo was taken.</td>', 'Impressive photo.  I love the angle that this photo was taken.', '2008-03-22 11:26:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580007, 658797, 88923, '<td valign="top">The stars and the lighting from behind really add to your lovely photo.  I don''t know if I like the shadow or not.</td>', 'The stars and the lighting from behind really add to your lovely photo.  I don''t know if I like the shadow or not.', '2008-03-22 11:27:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580008, 658307, 88923, '<td valign="top">This speaks cold, cold, cold.  The photo says it all.</td>', 'This speaks cold, cold, cold.  The photo says it all.', '2008-03-22 11:28:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580011, 657981, 88923, '<td valign="top">Nice impression.  Love the angle and the light on the rocks.</td>', 'Nice impression.  Love the angle and the light on the rocks.', '2008-03-22 11:30:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580017, 658559, 88923, '<td valign="top">Surreal impression and tastefully done.  Nice composition.</td>', 'Surreal impression and tastefully done.  Nice composition.', '2008-03-22 11:34:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580018, 658479, 88923, '<td valign="top">Yes, this really does look harsh.</td>', 'Yes, this really does look harsh.', '2008-03-22 11:34:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580033, 658728, 88676, '<td valign="top">I am a big fan of this photo, I love the outstretched neck and the details on the goat.</td>', 'I am a big fan of this photo, I love the outstretched neck and the details on the goat.', '2008-03-22 11:51:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580038, 658736, 58452, '<td valign="top">I really like this composition. I wonder if it might have been over sharpened a bit. The bent perspective doesn''t hurt at all. The towers lean to the right might well have been intentional!!!  Nice image.</td>', 'I really like this composition. I wonder if it might have been over sharpened a bit. The bent perspective doesn''t hurt at all. The towers lean to the right might well have been intentional!!!  Nice image.', '2008-03-22 11:53:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580039, 658602, 58452, '<td valign="top">A bit dark for me.  And I''m in a dark room with a calibrated monitor.  It does add a certain gloomy mood. I think a little more exposure in the city area would have been nice.</td>', 'A bit dark for me.  And I''m in a dark room with a calibrated monitor.  It does add a certain gloomy mood. I think a little more exposure in the city area would have been nice.', '2008-03-22 11:56:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580040, 657213, 88676, '<td valign="top">one of my top pics in the challenge, I like the use of light.  could do without the sunglasses on the ground.</td>', 'one of my top pics in the challenge, I like the use of light.  could do without the sunglasses on the ground.', '2008-03-22 11:56:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580043, 658084, 88676, '<td valign="top">one of my top picks in the challenge.  the sky is dark and adds great contrast to the clouds; however the far right cloud just doesn''t do it for me, so you''ll have to settle for a 9</td>', 'one of my top picks in the challenge.  the sky is dark and adds great contrast to the clouds; however the far right cloud just doesn''t do it for me, so you''ll have to settle for a 9', '2008-03-22 11:58:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580045, 658763, 88676, '<td valign="top">a nice wide angle shot with great scolors in the sky.  the water looks cold!</td>', 'a nice wide angle shot with great scolors in the sky.  the water looks cold!', '2008-03-22 11:59:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580047, 658483, 88676, '<td valign="top">you pulled this off well, it actually looks like it is really (REALLY) cold</td>', 'you pulled this off well, it actually looks like it is really (REALLY) cold', '2008-03-22 12:00:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580048, 658523, 58452, '<td valign="top">I like the way his top knot is disturbed by the wind. Good job getting a sharp image in high winds. You must have boosted ISO, but you controlled noise very well. Nice image.</td>', 'I like the way his top knot is disturbed by the wind. Good job getting a sharp image in high winds. You must have boosted ISO, but you controlled noise very well. Nice image.', '2008-03-22 12:01:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580050, 658212, 88676, '<td valign="top">what is stopping me from giving this any more than an 8 is the image just looks to "smooth" for a harsh environment.</td>', 'what is stopping me from giving this any more than an 8 is the image just looks to "smooth" for a harsh environment.', '2008-03-22 12:01:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580053, 657343, 58452, '<td valign="top">While the almost totally blown snow in front distracts a bit, the composition of the horse with the falling snow adds a dreamy, almost fairy-tale effect for me.  Very nice.</td>', 'While the almost totally blown snow in front distracts a bit, the composition of the horse with the falling snow adds a dreamy, almost fairy-tale effect for me.  Very nice.', '2008-03-22 12:03:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580054, 658521, 88676, '<td valign="top">I''m trying to think of something critical, but can''t...good job!</td>', 'I''m trying to think of something critical, but can''t...good job!', '2008-03-22 12:03:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580055, 658266, 58452, '<td valign="top">Looks like he''s snoring.  LOL</td>', 'Looks like he''s snoring.  LOL', '2008-03-22 12:03:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580138, 657713, 68514, '<td valign="top">Very very nice, but i''d like more contrast on BW. 8 :)</td>', 'Very very nice, but i''d like more contrast on BW. 8 :)', '2008-03-22 13:27:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580139, 657745, 68514, '<td valign="top">Amazing post production, but the horizon line seems not to be straight. Godd anyway, 8.</td>', 'Amazing post production, but the horizon line seems not to be straight. Godd anyway, 8.', '2008-03-22 13:27:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580145, 657778, 91676, '<td valign="top">realy nice</td>', 'realy nice', '2008-03-22 13:33:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580228, 658647, 58452, '<td valign="top">Stay of course.</td>', 'Stay of course.', '2008-03-22 15:16:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580541, 657734, 58452, '<td valign="top">Hmmmm, I like the pattern of the flames. I wonder why the reflection of duckie''s head looks blurred. Hope no villages got burned in the production of this shot.  LOL</td>', 'Hmmmm, I like the pattern of the flames. I wonder why the reflection of duckie''s head looks blurred. Hope no villages got burned in the production of this shot.  LOL', '2008-03-22 20:13:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580543, 658315, 58452, '<td valign="top">I like the soft contrasting colors along with the delicate limb structures superimposed. Nice composition too. I think the frame may actually add a little to this one.  Very nice.</td>', 'I like the soft contrasting colors along with the delicate limb structures superimposed. Nice composition too. I think the frame may actually add a little to this one.  Very nice.', '2008-03-22 20:14:36.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4580547, 658728, 58452, '<td valign="top">Man!  Scared me.  When the image first came up I thought it was a velociraptor! That''s a heck of a goat! Love the perspective. Nice.</td>', 'Man!  Scared me.  When the image first came up I thought it was a velociraptor! That''s a heck of a goat! Love the perspective. Nice.', '2008-03-22 20:17:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580552, 657240, 58452, '<td valign="top">I like the combination of colors and the patchy snow across the middle.  Might be a bit stronger composition if you cropped down from the top and only left the portion of the sky with striking  detail. Just a nit pic.</td>', 'I like the combination of colors and the patchy snow across the middle.  Might be a bit stronger composition if you cropped down from the top and only left the portion of the sky with striking  detail. Just a nit pic.', '2008-03-22 20:20:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580558, 657029, 58452, '<td valign="top">Haunting eyes in this composition. I like the almost mono-color effect you achieved in the image.  Very nice.  Congrats. Coming back after voting on the rest. I think I like this one the best. Bumping it up a point.</td>', 'Haunting eyes in this composition. I like the almost mono-color effect you achieved in the image.  Very nice.  Congrats. Coming back after voting on the rest. I think I like this one the best. Bumping it up a point.', '2008-03-22 20:25:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580560, 658521, 58452, '<td valign="top">I don''t know how harsh this is.... but I love the combination colors and forms here.  Nice.</td>', 'I don''t know how harsh this is.... but I love the combination colors and forms here.  Nice.', '2008-03-22 20:26:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580583, 658728, 33515, '<td valign="top">Not an overwhelming feeling of harsh environment, but a great picture no less. Great angle, the lighting and textures on the goat is good and the processing is very well done. The burned out sky fights for attentions but overall a very nice photo.</td>', 'Not an overwhelming feeling of harsh environment, but a great picture no less. Great angle, the lighting and textures on the goat is good and the processing is very well done. The burned out sky fights for attentions but overall a very nice photo.', '2008-03-22 20:36:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580585, 658804, 58452, '<td valign="top">Removes the colours from our sight...<br/>Certainly a harsh environment. Maybe a touch more exposure. Nice moon. :)</td>', 'Removes the colours from our sight...Certainly a harsh environment. Maybe a touch more exposure. Nice moon. :)', '2008-03-22 20:37:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580587, 657713, 33515, '<td valign="top">Oh my, this is a good one. I don''t know what to say about this, it''s the perfect photo for the challenge and I hope your score is reflecting it. First rate processing and what a great eye for "seeing" this.</td>', 'Oh my, this is a good one. I don''t know what to say about this, it''s the perfect photo for the challenge and I hope your score is reflecting it. First rate processing and what a great eye for "seeing" this.', '2008-03-22 20:40:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580589, 658712, 58452, '<td valign="top">Nice, simple, bold, composition. I think the graduant of colors across the wick adds a lot to the image. Wish there''d been a bit more contrast there.</td>', 'Nice, simple, bold, composition. I think the graduant of colors across the wick adds a lot to the image. Wish there''d been a bit more contrast there.', '2008-03-22 20:42:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580590, 658799, 58452, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition.  Wish there''d been a bit more blue mixed in the sky. But I guess that would be very harsh.  :)</td>', 'Beautiful composition.  Wish there''d been a bit more blue mixed in the sky. But I guess that would be very harsh.  :)', '2008-03-22 20:43:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580591, 658337, 58452, '<td valign="top">Great action capture. I know from experience just how harsh this can be.  Nice composition.</td>', 'Great action capture. I know from experience just how harsh this can be.  Nice composition.', '2008-03-22 20:44:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580592, 658617, 33515, '<td valign="top">I think by including the tops of the brush in the photo it removes a lot of the tension, you know he''s not that far off the ground.</td>', 'I think by including the tops of the brush in the photo it removes a lot of the tension, you know he''s not that far off the ground.', '2008-03-22 20:45:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580594, 658084, 58452, '<td valign="top">I wonder how you got the gold effect on the peaks. Very nice composition.</td>', 'I wonder how you got the gold effect on the peaks. Very nice composition.', '2008-03-22 20:48:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580596, 658736, 33515, '<td valign="top">A bit heavy handed on the processing, the guys faces is way to red and stands out. The motion blur of the bus and the flags adds a nice touch.</td>', 'A bit heavy handed on the processing, the guys faces is way to red and stands out. The motion blur of the bus and the flags adds a nice touch.', '2008-03-22 20:48:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580598, 657343, 33515, '<td valign="top">Very good but I can''t help but feeling if you had more of the horse, much more, and less of the foreground this would be great.</td>', 'Very good but I can''t help but feeling if you had more of the horse, much more, and less of the foreground this would be great.', '2008-03-22 20:49:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4580599, 657714, 58452, '<td valign="top">I think we allow 720 pixels on a side now.  It''s just difficult to get much detail out of such a small image.  :)</td>', 'I think we allow 720 pixels on a side now.  It''s just difficult to get much detail out of such a small image.  :)', '2008-03-22 20:52:34.000000', NULL, 1),
