(4581407, 658736, 54540, '<td valign="top">Excellent treatment of the clouds - makes for a really good backdrop to the foreground colors and subject of the image.  Excellent use of blur to convey the motion of the bus.  One of my favorites of the challenge.</td>', 'Excellent treatment of the clouds - makes for a really good backdrop to the foreground colors and subject of the image.  Excellent use of blur to convey the motion of the bus.  One of my favorites of the challenge.', '2008-03-23 14:25:21.000000', NULL, 1),
