(4581479, 658804, 54540, '<td valign="top">Excellent lunar detail, nice and sharp.  My two cents, this image would do even better if the levels were pushed to get some true white highlights on the surface, to acheive that same look as when you are peering through a telescope.  The black levels are ideal, it just lacks the whites for me.<br/>I like this composition and good choice to add the simple frame.<br/>A very good lunar photo to be proud of!</td>', 'Excellent lunar detail, nice and sharp.  My two cents, this image would do even better if the levels were pushed to get some true white highlights on the surface, to acheive that same look as when you are peering through a telescope.  The black levels are ideal, it just lacks the whites for me.I like this composition and good choice to add the simple frame.A very good lunar photo to be proud of!', '2008-03-23 15:14:53.000000', NULL, 1),
