(4582645, 657235, 72318, '<td valign="top">Nice one... loved the tones/textures you pulled on this, a very interesting place - tho it worries me that you are trying for world domination with squirrels :P <br/> <br/>PS. My throat is a bit dry ;)</td>', 'Nice one... loved the tones/textures you pulled on this, a very interesting place - tho it worries me that you are trying for world domination with squirrels :P  PS. My throat is a bit dry ;)', '2008-03-24 06:37:54.000000', NULL, 0),
