(4582654, 658712, 53572, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=657241" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657241.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657241.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657241.jpg"/></a> beautiful colours, wonderful abstraction, just enough information to let us know the subject.  the composition is fab, in fact the whole is that wonderful combination of surface beauty and brains that we see so seldom.  a very satisfying work.</td>', ' beautiful colours, wonderful abstraction, just enough information to let us know the subject.  the composition is fab, in fact the whole is that wonderful combination of surface beauty and brains that we see so seldom.  a very satisfying work.', '2008-03-24 07:02:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(4582655, 658731, 53572, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=657243" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657243.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657243.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657243.jpg"/></a> as an ex-cycle courier, this image really resonates.  the darkness, while criticised by many, epitomises the grimy reality of urban cycling, as does the face mask.  i love the zooming composition, the texture of the wall, and the touch of red in the reflector.</td>', ' as an ex-cycle courier, this image really resonates.  the darkness, while criticised by many, epitomises the grimy reality of urban cycling, as does the face mask.  i love the zooming composition, the texture of the wall, and the touch of red in the reflector.', '2008-03-24 07:03:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(4582656, 657967, 53572, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=657242" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657242.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657242.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657242.jpg"/></a> the shiny chrome here is so good; the distortion, griminess, implicit (streaks on the bumper) and explicit (exhaust pipe) pollution.  the tones are rich and deep, that sky is lovely, and the image makes one think as well.</td>', ' the shiny chrome here is so good; the distortion, griminess, implicit (streaks on the bumper) and explicit (exhaust pipe) pollution.  the tones are rich and deep, that sky is lovely, and the image makes one think as well.', '2008-03-24 07:04:00.000000', NULL, 0),
