(4582877, 657967, 67697, '<td valign="top">Very, very creative Charlene!  What a find - you almost cannot even tell where the car begins and ends.  How appropriate that the exhaust there - as an example of one source of pollution.  A beautiful piece of art.  Congrats on the X-Prize!</td>', 'Very, very creative Charlene!  What a find - you almost cannot even tell where the car begins and ends.  How appropriate that the exhaust there - as an example of one source of pollution.  A beautiful piece of art.  Congrats on the X-Prize!', '2008-03-24 09:12:23.000000', NULL, 0),
