(4582934, 658307, 67697, '<td valign="top">I actually like the facial expression because it enhances the emotional element of the scene.  It shows that someone is probably freezing their ass off, hehe.  Great mood.  I love how the noise is like little black and white snowflakes floating around.  Very cool.</td>', 'I actually like the facial expression because it enhances the emotional element of the scene.  It shows that someone is probably freezing their ass off, hehe.  Great mood.  I love how the noise is like little black and white snowflakes floating around.  Very cool.', '2008-03-24 09:35:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(4582940, 658563, 67697, '<td valign="top">hmmm still looking for that vague, far side hole.  oh well, i''m not all that observant.  This is very cool.  It leaves a lot of room for interpretation.  My take is that this is a fire place and that there''s an aluminum christmas tree in there that did not quite melt.  Interesting find!</td>', 'hmmm still looking for that vague, far side hole.  oh well, i''m not all that observant.  This is very cool.  It leaves a lot of room for interpretation.  My take is that this is a fire place and that there''s an aluminum christmas tree in there that did not quite melt.  Interesting find!', '2008-03-24 09:38:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(4582942, 658631, 67697, '<td valign="top">Oh cool, you guys are in Paris!  This is such a European scene, with the street environment and the red umbrella.  Love how that color stands out.  Good job holding your camera still on such a windy day :)  Beautiful title.</td>', 'Oh cool, you guys are in Paris!  This is such a European scene, with the street environment and the red umbrella.  Love how that color stands out.  Good job holding your camera still on such a windy day :)  Beautiful title.', '2008-03-24 09:39:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(4582944, 658306, 52549, '<td valign="top">This is a fantastic shot, Karen. I noticed and admired it during voting. Can''t understand why it didn''t do better.</td>', 'This is a fantastic shot, Karen. I noticed and admired it during voting. Can''t understand why it didn''t do better.', '2008-03-24 09:40:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(4582947, 658731, 67697, '<td valign="top">That really is an unusual sight.  I like the darkness and grittiness of the photo.  It complements the guy''s outfit and gas mask lol.  Hope you are enjoying Paris!  Oh and congrats on that X-prize too.</td>', 'That really is an unusual sight.  I like the darkness and grittiness of the photo.  It complements the guy''s outfit and gas mask lol.  Hope you are enjoying Paris!  Oh and congrats on that X-prize too.', '2008-03-24 09:41:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(4582950, 658093, 67697, '<td valign="top">Great processing - I love how you made this typical scene pop!  That blue square looks like a TV set.  This makes you wonder about the history of the building.  Interesting find.</td>', 'Great processing - I love how you made this typical scene pop!  That blue square looks like a TV set.  This makes you wonder about the history of the building.  Interesting find.', '2008-03-24 09:44:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(4582961, 658631, 15711, '<td valign="top">I found this one of the better harsh environment photos.  I think the way DPC voters are though, it has to be so literal, it knocks them in the head. LOL</td>', 'I found this one of the better harsh environment photos.  I think the way DPC voters are though, it has to be so literal, it knocks them in the head. LOL', '2008-03-24 09:49:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(4582978, 658106, 67697, '<td valign="top">Sneaky, tricking the voters with a title.  Without the title, my thoughts would have been more of a severe storm coming in and this bright tower was going to be in the middle of it.  This does look good in black and white.  I love the brightness of the tower and how you made it stand out from the rest of the photo.  The sky and the hills blending together look like a watercolor painting.  It''s an interesting capture.</td>', 'Sneaky, tricking the voters with a title.  Without the title, my thoughts would have been more of a severe storm coming in and this bright tower was going to be in the middle of it.  This does look good in black and white.  I love the brightness of the tower and how you made it stand out from the rest of the photo.  The sky and the hills blending together look like a watercolor painting.  It''s an interesting capture.', '2008-03-24 09:54:33.000000', NULL, 0),
