(4583548, 658798, 9763, '<td valign="top">I was hoping to do better with this one.  I was hand-holding an HDR shot, so I thought the focus was pretty good considering.  The landscape by Barker Dam was gorgeous!  You should all go out there sometime!  Anyhow, thanks for your comments.  I''ll try for higher next time :)</td>', 'I was hoping to do better with this one.  I was hand-holding an HDR shot, so I thought the focus was pretty good considering.  The landscape by Barker Dam was gorgeous!  You should all go out there sometime!  Anyhow, thanks for your comments.  I''ll try for higher next time :)', '2008-03-24 14:31:03.000000', NULL, 0),
