(4584932, 658093, 66384, '<td valign="top">Love the processing! And the three primary colors really work to enhance this wonderful composition. What an amazing eye you have. I love the fact that I rarely recognize an image as being yours -- you have such a broad range of styles and subjects -- but I usually spend a lot of time with them and they stay with me.<br/> <br/>P.S. Larry said that in addition to the photo, he loves the title. I have to agree with him.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-03-25 08:12:50.</i></td>', 'Love the processing! And the three primary colors really work to enhance this wonderful composition. What an amazing eye you have. I love the fact that I rarely recognize an image as being yours -- you have such a broad range of styles and subjects -- but I usually spend a lot of time with them and they stay with me. P.S. Larry said that in addition to the photo, he loves the title. I have to agree with him.', '2008-03-25 08:09:23.000000', '2008-03-25 08:12:50.000000', 0),
(4585054, 657713, 65713, '<td valign="top">Love the shot and think you''re right about the contrast. Makes me homesick, not worrying about a brolly, so British.</td>', 'Love the shot and think you''re right about the contrast. Makes me homesick, not worrying about a brolly, so British.', '2008-03-25 09:02:07.000000', NULL, 0),
