(4585823, 657961, 66384, '<td valign="top">I like your processing, Kelly. Clutter is what you wanted to show, and you did a good job with this scene. I like the high angle you used. Too bad voters don''t like cluttered images, and probably didn''t make an exception for this challenge. Anyway I hope you get things straightened out soon -- I don''t like thinking of you in a "harsh environment".</td>', 'I like your processing, Kelly. Clutter is what you wanted to show, and you did a good job with this scene. I like the high angle you used. Too bad voters don''t like cluttered images, and probably didn''t make an exception for this challenge. Anyway I hope you get things straightened out soon -- I don''t like thinking of you in a "harsh environment".', '2008-03-25 13:51:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(4585828, 657714, 66952, '<td valign="top">I didn''t vote in this challenge, but I loved reading the comments afterwards. To me, however, this looks more like a cave than a coal mine. Maybe if you sized it at 640x, I might see what you were getting at.</td>', 'I didn''t vote in this challenge, but I loved reading the comments afterwards. To me, however, this looks more like a cave than a coal mine. Maybe if you sized it at 640x, I might see what you were getting at.', '2008-03-25 13:54:41.000000', NULL, 0),
