(4586187, 657967, 44877, '<td valign="top">Charlene - I absolutely loved this during voting and gave it an 8. I''m shocked that it didn''t finish higher - but you know how it is... probably too arty, or something. <br/> <br/>In any case I like it. It''s so well seen and executed. I''ve always been fond of your B&amp;W photos.<br/> <br/>Edit to add: <br/> <br/>You got an <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=624708&amp;highlight=posthumous" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">X-prize</a>!!<br/> <br/>Congratulations!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-03-26 15:24:59.</i></td>', 'Charlene - I absolutely loved this during voting and gave it an 8. I''m shocked that it didn''t finish higher - but you know how it is... probably too arty, or something.  In any case I like it. It''s so well seen and executed. I''ve always been fond of your B&W photos. Edit to add:  You got an X-prize!! Congratulations!', '2008-03-25 16:20:31.000000', '2008-03-26 15:24:59.000000', 0),
