(4587009, 657029, 67697, '<td valign="top">I think this is a type of harsh environment that not many will ever understand.  Those eyes are heartbreakers.  I love it when you do your animal adoption related photos!  Thanks for sharing.</td>', 'I think this is a type of harsh environment that not many will ever understand.  Those eyes are heartbreakers.  I love it when you do your animal adoption related photos!  Thanks for sharing.', '2008-03-25 22:35:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(4587014, 658084, 23002, '<td valign="top">Wonderful image! The lighting is perfect, composition is inspiring.  I never would have thought to put person in a shot like this, but it really pulls it all together and no doubt helped to make it stand out from the other landscapes.  This is a fave for me!<br/> <br/>(p.s. my family moved to Canada from Rocca San Giovanni in Chieti in the late 1930''s, I would love to visit my relatives there sometime.  Way farther south than where this was taken, but still on the Adriatic side)</td>', 'Wonderful image! The lighting is perfect, composition is inspiring.  I never would have thought to put person in a shot like this, but it really pulls it all together and no doubt helped to make it stand out from the other landscapes.  This is a fave for me! (p.s. my family moved to Canada from Rocca San Giovanni in Chieti in the late 1930''s, I would love to visit my relatives there sometime.  Way farther south than where this was taken, but still on the Adriatic side)', '2008-03-25 22:35:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(4587015, 658485, 67697, '<td valign="top">I love seeing all the crinkled branches.  It''s like they are out to get you.  Beautiful processing.</td>', 'I love seeing all the crinkled branches.  It''s like they are out to get you.  Beautiful processing.', '2008-03-25 22:37:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(4587086, 657029, 23002, '<td valign="top">Very sad.  At least where you live they have the right to life still.  My province has outlawed them completely. (they should be making anyone with a criminal record that involves violence take a course before they can own a dog instead..but that will never happen) Shelters here have been pretty good at getting the pitty''s moved to another province though so they still have a chance.</td>', 'Very sad.  At least where you live they have the right to life still.  My province has outlawed them completely. (they should be making anyone with a criminal record that involves violence take a course before they can own a dog instead..but that will never happen) Shelters here have been pretty good at getting the pitty''s moved to another province though so they still have a chance.', '2008-03-25 23:20:00.000000', NULL, 0),
