(4599548, 657961, 30982, '<td valign="top">As often as I move, I can totally understand the harshness of that environment.  Totally.  You knew where things were before (more or less) and now you have to try to put them in relatively corresponding places or you''ll never be able to find them again.  Or maybe that only happens as you get older.  :-)  Enjoy the unpacking, and enjoy the new place!</td>', 'As often as I move, I can totally understand the harshness of that environment.  Totally.  You knew where things were before (more or less) and now you have to try to put them in relatively corresponding places or you''ll never be able to find them again.  Or maybe that only happens as you get older.  :-)  Enjoy the unpacking, and enjoy the new place!', '2008-03-31 18:38:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(4599670, 657734, 62787, '<td valign="top">lol How cool! Great pic, and made me laugh a lot :)</td>', 'lol How cool! Great pic, and made me laugh a lot :)', '2008-03-31 19:50:44.000000', NULL, 0),
