(4609471, 658795, 66253, '<td valign="top">You know, I did take some other shots in which the car was less obscured, but I didn''t think they conveyed "harshness" as well. Also, by this date the snow was receding a bit, and I wanted to maximize the buried look. And the sky was lovely bright cheerful blue that day, too, not harsh at all, except perhaps in an intellectual "nature doesn''t care about your problems, silly mortal" kind of way. :^)<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//bp0.blogger.com/_2cHpQ_p0_Rw/R93vA2Qm2UI/AAAAAAAAA1I/OT27KlKywgw/s1600/20080312.jpg'', strrpos(''//bp0.blogger.com/_2cHpQ_p0_Rw/R93vA2Qm2UI/AAAAAAAAA1I/OT27KlKywgw/s1600/20080312.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//bp0.blogger.com/_2cHpQ_p0_Rw/R93vA2Qm2UI/AAAAAAAAA1I/OT27KlKywgw/s1600/20080312.jpg"/></td>', 'You know, I did take some other shots in which the car was less obscured, but I didn''t think they conveyed "harshness" as well. Also, by this date the snow was receding a bit, and I wanted to maximize the buried look. And the sky was lovely bright cheerful blue that day, too, not harsh at all, except perhaps in an intellectual "nature doesn''t care about your problems, silly mortal" kind of way. :^) ', '2008-04-03 01:00:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(4612052, 658702, 72318, '<td valign="top">Maybe some people saw it as an ironic statement - and gave you a 9 or 10 for inferred creative genius? I gave a 3 actually... probably because the concept was good and that i reserve 2''s for badly sized shots and i have never given a 1 to my knowledge ;P</td>', 'Maybe some people saw it as an ironic statement - and gave you a 9 or 10 for inferred creative genius? I gave a 3 actually... probably because the concept was good and that i reserve 2''s for badly sized shots and i have never given a 1 to my knowledge ;P', '2008-04-03 22:07:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(4615187, 658306, 68035, '<td valign="top">If this is a 5 then I am a chicken called Henry!!<br/> <br/>What a fantastic shot that met the challenge in a breathtaking way<br/> <br/>I just love the way the topography has been caught and produced such a harsh sharp patchwork quilt effect<br/> <br/>I am staggered at how you did not get any reflection from the airplane window and of how - in far from ideal conditions - you got such great textures colours and sharpness<br/> <br/>Scored this an 8 in the challenge and think I was being very stingy<br/> <br/>Beautiful</td>', 'If this is a 5 then I am a chicken called Henry!! What a fantastic shot that met the challenge in a breathtaking way I just love the way the topography has been caught and produced such a harsh sharp patchwork quilt effect I am staggered at how you did not get any reflection from the airplane window and of how - in far from ideal conditions - you got such great textures colours and sharpness Scored this an 8 in the challenge and think I was being very stingy Beautiful', '2008-04-05 04:15:07.000000', NULL, 0),
