(4876578, 658209, 48228, '<td valign="top">Finally I have found the image I have been looking for fro quite some time. This has been in the back of my mind, that when I first saw this, I should have added it to ''my favorites''. I am adding it right now As I love the concept, the crop, the detail, the awesome DOF, the rich earthy colors, and also the textures.</td>', 'Finally I have found the image I have been looking for fro quite some time. This has been in the back of my mind, that when I first saw this, I should have added it to ''my favorites''. I am adding it right now As I love the concept, the crop, the detail, the awesome DOF, the rich earthy colors, and also the textures.', '2008-08-09 02:42:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(4930690, 658728, 61651, '<td valign="top">I want to say "vertiginous", but the perspective here is of one looking up, not down - but vertiginous is still a good word for it, at least for the feeling it engenders - you get the sense of being struck here, of being off balance and unsafe.  Toning gives it an effective nightmarish quality.</td>', 'I want to say "vertiginous", but the perspective here is of one looking up, not down - but vertiginous is still a good word for it, at least for the feeling it engenders - you get the sense of being struck here, of being off balance and unsafe.  Toning gives it an effective nightmarish quality.', '2008-09-03 09:33:33.000000', NULL, 0),
