(4975277, 658093, 68504, '<td valign="top">Here is something to contemplate. Tells us who we are, and that we have no idea what we have been. Processing a great fit.</td>', 'Here is something to contemplate. Tells us who we are, and that we have no idea what we have been. Processing a great fit.', '2008-09-25 16:25:08.000000', NULL, 0),
